==Russian==

===Alternative forms===
* {{alt|ru|во-||before certain consonant clusters}}

===Etymology===
{{inh+|ru|orv|въ-}}, from {{inh|ru|sla-pro|*vъ(n)-}}, from {{inh|ru|ine-pro|*h₁én}}. The {{IPAchar|/n/}} persists in {{m|ru|внять}}. See also {{m|ru|в}}, {{cog|orv|въ}}, {{cog|sla-pro|*vъ(n)}}. Compare the similar development in {{m|ru|с-}} from {{ncog|sla-pro|*sъ(n)-}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|в-}} {{i|before vowels and voiced consonants}}
* {{ru-IPA|ф-}} {{i|before voiceless consonants}}

===Prefix===
{{head|ru|prefix|cat2=verbal prefixes}}

# {{n-g|added to verbs, forms verbs with the approximate meaning 'in' or '[[into]]'}}
#: {{prefex|ru|!во-|-йти́|t2=to go|войти́|t3=to go in, to enter}}
# {{n-g|added with {{m|ru|-ся}} to verbs, forms verbs with the approximate meaning of thoroughness or completeness of action}}
#: {{prefex|ru|!в-|чита́ть|t2=to read|-ся|вчита́ться|t4=to read carefully, delving into the content to better understand}}
# {{n-g|added to adjectives, forms adverbs with the approximate meaning 'in the manner of [the adjective]'}}
#: {{prefex|ru|в-|ручно́й|t2=(relational) hand; manual|вручну́ю|t3=manually (by hand)}}
# {{n-g|added to nouns, forms adverbs with the approximate meaning 'in the direction or location of [the noun]'}}
#: {{prefex|ru|в-|нутро́|t2=the inside|внутри́|t3=inside}}
#: {{prefex|ru|в-|низ|t2=the bottom|вниз|t3=downwards}}
# {{n-g|added to numerals, forms adverbs based on the numeral}}
#: {{prefex|ru|в-|дво́е|t2=two (in a group together)|вдво́е|t3=twice, by half}}
#: {{prefex|ru|в-|дво́е|t2=two (in a group together)|вдвоём|t3=as a two}}

